          %p We have then the essentially verbatim analog of the situation for ordinary categories:
          #LocallyPresentableInfinityCategory.num_defn
            %h6#definition_16 Definition
            %p
              An
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category"} (∞,1)-category
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
